+{"v":1,"id":"01M77ZWRM0FFWCCJSFR6CHAT7K","ts":"2026-11-12T13:41:57.504333Z","actor":"claude-grill-146","type":"node.add","node":"01M77ZWRM0FFWCCJSFR6CHAT7K","payload":{"kind":"DesignQuestion","parent":"01M77ZWK4EGCHQH9KH8XQXM27F","title":"Which change keeps a grill from repeating S1 to S6 of #146?","body":"A rival's candidate is one commit. Each fixture runs 3 trials under it and 3 under the base, a fresh Sonnet session each; the stand-in approves each owner write. A trial with no Goal with lines passes no line of 1 to 6. eval_skill.py (sha256 c47a38dee2456cc6172dff28472052c0f7b28d7baf310af6e83b5ca655d10a24, External:) grades; a reviewer who did not run the trial and does not know its arm grades each rubric assertion. Cost: the sum of total_cost_usd over a trial's calls; median: the middle of 3, a trial with no record counting highest.","alias":"q-grill-fix"},"why":"The grill's contested question: where the fix for S1 to S6 lives; separated by replaying fixtures A and B."}
+{"v":1,"id":"01M77ZX09VMV4RQD726KZ8WNJK","ts":"2026-11-12T13:42:05.371983Z","actor":"claude-grill-146","type":"node.add","node":"01M77ZX09VMV4RQD726KZ8WNJK","payload":{"kind":"Hypothesis","parent":"01M77ZWRM0FFWCCJSFR6CHAT7K","title":"Fix each entry of S1 to S6 where it arises in SKILL.md","body":"Fix each red entry where it arises in SKILL.md: Start finds the place the repository's instructions name (S1); the [N] form names the check for the candidate's kind (S2); a routing row sends a method another skill owns to that skill (S3); the six questions add a full-sha256 and one-assertion check (S4); May change: and Never: are checked against each other and the test route (S5); the guard checks its fact in the source (S6).","alias":"entry-edits"},"why":"Rival 1 from the grill: per-entry edits."}
+{"v":1,"id":"01M77ZX0AT44P3RJA9V66M7FDJ","ts":"2026-11-12T13:42:05.402531Z","actor":"claude-grill-146","type":"node.add","node":"01M77ZX0AT44P3RJA9V66M7FDJ","payload":{"kind":"Hypothesis","parent":"01M77ZWRM0FFWCCJSFR6CHAT7K","title":"One S1 to S6 checklist run before each round and before the routing","body":"Keep the steps and add one checklist of S1 to S6, run before each round is sent to the owner and again before Confirm the routing.","alias":"preflight"},"why":"Rival 2 from the grill: one checklist instead of per-entry edits."}
