+{"v":1,"id":"01M77ZWK4EGCHQH9KH8XQXM27F","ts":"2026-11-12T13:41:51.886415Z","actor":"owner-dat","type":"node.add","node":"01M77ZWK4EGCHQH9KH8XQXM27F","payload":{"kind":"Goal","parent":"","title":"hyp-owner-grill keeps a grill from repeating S1 to S6 of #146, and hyp add goal refuses a truncated sha256","body":"For issue #146 (part of #113). The candidate is a hyp commit over main 132cb8e21ad5750266e11d413a172d1d9a891976 that changes skills/hyp-owner-grill to fix entries S1 to S6 of #146, and hyp add goal for line 9; S7 is another Goal. An entry whose line holds on the base is recorded as not a skill defect, citing that Result, with no text change; for S2 the stop names SKILL.md's [N] rule as an out-of-Goal finding.\nFixture A: the #113 grill; repository and hyp at a51f140; issue #113 as of 2026-11-11T16:20Z. Fixture B: the #141 grill; repository and hyp at 9c8e498; issue #141 as of 2026-11-12T03:45Z. A trial runs the grill under the candidate or base text in a sandbox; a stand-in owner gives the owner's replies in session 285fa63e or f50e4740 to the questions the grill asks, paraphrased in a bundle file.\nMay change: this repository, in commits on the branch the prompt names, in a worktree separate from the checkout ~/.claude/skills links to, following AGENTS.md; it may push that branch and open or update one PR.\nMay change: skills/hyp-owner-grill and every text the change makes wrong (skills/, docs/, AGENTS.md, README.md); cmd/, internal/ and testdata for line 9; a new investigations/goal-prompt/recipes/hyp-owner-grill-eval@N.\nRead only: plans/, every investigations/ tree except goal-prompt, ak-skill-creator under .claude/skills, transcripts 285fa63e and f50e4740 for the stand-in's replies.\nNever: commit to main or merge a PR.\nNever: replace an installed hyp; build each candidate to its own path.\nNever: edit a recipe version, rubrics/, another tree, .claude/skills or another repository.\nNever: commit the transcripts 285fa63e or f50e4740 or text copied from them.\nNever: let a trial reach a remote or write outside its sandbox, or run a trial or its subagents on any model but Sonnet.\nNever: write under an owner's actor outside a trial's sandbox store, where the stand-in is owner-standin; if a step needs the owner, refer or record a reading, and stop.","alias":"owner-grill","lines":[{"text":"[P] On fixtures A and B, each Goal with lines that the grill writes is in a store under the directory the fixture's AGENTS.md names for trees, the existing store there that holds a Goal of the issue's parent when one does (fixture B: investigations/goal-prompt), and the grill runs no hyp init at the repository root, in at least 2 of the 3 trials on each fixture."},{"text":"[N] On fixture A, whose candidate is a read command (hyp prompt), no [N] line the grill writes says that a write is refused or that a log is rejected on replay, and each [N] line names the output, exit code or refusal by which the candidate's tests decide it, in at least 2 of the 3 trials on fixture A."},{"text":"[N] On fixture A, the grill never puts to the owner as a choice a part of a test method that ak-skill-creator's eval flow owns (its cases, fixtures, clause matching or grading); about the test method it asks only whether to use that flow and the owner's preferences of model, trial count and budget, in at least 2 of the 3 trials on fixture A."},{"text":"[N] On fixtures A and B, no line the grill writes names a file by a sha256 shorter than 64 hex digits, or names its grader without the one command or assertion that decides it, in at least 2 of the 3 trials on each fixture."},{"text":"[N] On fixtures A and B, in each Goal with lines that the grill writes, no May change: line limits skills/, docs/, AGENTS.md or README.md to named files or parts, and no Never: line forbids a new recipe directory, in at least 2 of the 3 trials on each fixture."},{"text":"[N] On fixture B, no message the grill sends the owner rests a rival, field or line on a claim about what the log holds or who writes an event, unless the trial's transcript shows the grill read the source that decides the claim before that message; in particular it never says a review needs no stored mark because the actor is on every event, in at least 2 of the 3 trials on fixture B."},{"text":"[N] On fixture A or B, the median total_cost_usd of 3 trials under the candidate is never more than 1.5 times the median under the base on the same fixture, skills/hyp-owner-grill/SKILL.md sha256 1aca7adc095acae5143efd0311274871e304468eb9de976c3b1ca1382bfa4326; the candidate differs from it."},{"text":"[P] Each SKILL.md the candidate changes passes ak-skill-creator's quick_validate.py (sha256 d81f883a9ddbb87fa2b015781e42041811cb14750dd3a703cfaeca409c1d7247) with 0 errors and lint_cruft.py --routing (sha256 ff36baefb5aa720b3e74a4c3f71df3cdb1c88d320e8296f25ce1b961660a0946) with no High finding, and skillcheck passes."},{"text":"[N] hyp add goal refuses with exit 1, naming the rule, a line that names a hex run of 8 to 63 digits followed by an ellipsis (… or ...), and accepts the same line with all 64 digits; a log that already holds such a line still replays."}]},"why":"Owner, 2026-11-12: issue #146; lines confirmed in the grill session."}
