+{"v":1,"id":"01M781JM6FSGGZ27VC2CB3FRVA","ts":"2026-11-12T14:11:22.447373Z","actor":"claude-grill-113","type":"node.add","node":"01M781JM6FSGGZ27VC2CB3FRVA","payload":{"kind":"Experiment","parent":"01M781JGJY22AY56XG1EBM50HC","title":"Session decision on who produces the prompt","body":"Rule, fixed before the record: the owner settled this question in the session of 2026-11-12, so this Experiment is an argument, not a run. H-BM50HC supports when a command that reads the log can meet scenarios (a), (b) and (c) of the question. H-QZMAYS contradicts when prose written per session cannot guarantee (a) or (b): two sessions can word it differently (a), and no exit code can refuse a Goal with no block (b). Evidence: scenarios.md in this Experiment's evidence directory.","alias":"e-session","recipe":"none","targets":["01M781JGKMH2B48V4AGRQZMAYS"],"rubric":"reading"},"why":"Records the owner's settlement of Q-PZ1M37 with the session as evidence."}
