+{"parentUuid":"c60e81c1-cc6b-46b0-b1b9-db4b72958b65","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyB4ZnHJBHj31zu4dGFk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KZ3KLLhy54DYEEfAcwdz5s","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"mkdir -p $TMPDIR/dry && cd $TMPDIR/dry && rm -rf .tree && git init -q . 2>/dev/null; cat > $TMPDIR/goal-cmd.sh <<'EOF'\nhyp add goal --title \"Select the run practice that ends a budget-bound build run on a reviewed final candidate, without endless review\" --body $'Discovery Goal for issue #141 (part of #113), from the comments of runs 1 to 3 of G-ZBM2RE (observation entries R10, R14). The candidate is a run practice: a scratch patch to skills/hyp-goal-run/SKILL.md, internal/cli/prompt.go or a scratch hyp binary, never a commit. The landing of the winner is a separate build Goal that the owner adds after the select.\\nStart S1: the store cut after R-8JQPWG, repository at b4f23b2 (its skills/hyp-goal-run/SKILL.md sha256 a6152711c2c930b275583f19dec074205e3eb83deac8d361831fda3566b080ab, internal/cli/prompt.go sha256 674dc260b4863afdec8ea2a27383ebe909b0736e25278d79aea78ecc4738d08b), actor claude-g113-1, who then has 4 Results and one left. Start S2: the cut after R-JHBCWS, repository at 3cfd08d (those files sha256 cb15e2f2e207b5a66807c9369e4d776d5378e61c2dd99679c36dfba402fa750e and 21f9332383bc6b0eaf3d8e581eea0d397d06262ac45791dad035f0a421ce38ed), actor claude-g113-3, 4 Results left. A trial replays only from a cut, never a whole build, as a Sonnet run with the prompt that the candidate own hyp prints for the Goal with that actor and no --experiments flag. It reads hyp-goal-run from the patched sandbox clone; a trial that read another copy is void. Each candidate and the base get 3 trials at each start. A candidate patch is written once per start and always states how a review is recorded and whether it counts toward the stop clause.\\nPlan, staged: the base first, which also fixes the w