al of this store, `<tree>:<id>` included. It gives exit 3 for a store path with a control character, and for no store.\n  line G-SVK8PF#7: [N] `hyp add goal` with a body that has a heading line but no valid block exits 0, writes the Goal, and warns with the message `hyp prompt` gives for it. A valid block, or a body with no heading line, gives no warning. Replay and `hyp check` never warn on or reject a Goal for its block, so a store of Goals with no block checks `check: 0 errors`.\n  line G-SVK8PF#8: [P] The Hand off of skills/hyp-owner-grill runs `hyp prompt <G-id> --actor <runner-actor>` with the optional `--branch`, `--pr` and `--experiments`, gives its output as it is, and holds no instruction to hand-write a prompt. The skillcheck test passes.\n  line G-SVK8PF#9: [P] skills/hyp-goal-run has a section for a build Goal: one review round per candidate commit by a fresh subagent given the lines, the code and the keys settled with the owner's words, and a sort of each finding: a case of a line is a limit; a question about a line's meaning is a reading; a defect in text the run may edit is a fix commit; anything else is an out-of-Goal finding, named in the stop checkpoint and never holding the select.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxViolations":[],"sandboxed":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"57f1cede-a53e-42a9-b34a-a6fdba107f3d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"rule","ruleSource":"cliArg"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-cli","cwd":"/Users/datguy/.hyp-sandbox/g146-base-a-2/wt","sessionId":"e3ce0dbb-c168-4a49-9caf-ecc01cb40fbf","version":"2.1.322","gitBranch":"work"}
