+{"v":1,"id":"01M782AJ93XSQTMWJXBN8QBRN8","ts":"2026-11-12T14:24:26.915687Z","actor":"grill-141","type":"node.add","node":"01M782AJ93XSQTMWJXBN8QBRN8","payload":{"kind":"DesignQuestion","parent":"01M782A00343Y3KNWK017RHQKG","title":"How does a build Goal run keep every candidate reviewed within its budget, without reviews that go on over small changes","body":"Scenario: replay the cut after R-8JQPWG (candidate 5c5902d, fix 2284172 pending) and the cut after R-JHBCWS (candidate 3cfd08d, fix d2d5d14 pending); 3 trials per rival per cut, a fresh actor each, on Sonnet. A rival is a throwaway patch over skills/hyp-goal-run/SKILL.md (sha256 cb15e2f2e207b5a66807c9369e4d776d5378e61c2dd99679c36dfba402fa750e), or for raise-budget the --experiments default. The status quo is the baseline. A combination of rivals is added as a rival when the select needs it."},"why":"issue 141: one question for all rivals, as the owner decided"}
+{"v":1,"id":"01M782AVA6KNK88YZYWQT7QR7Q","ts":"2026-11-12T14:24:36.166451Z","actor":"grill-141","type":"node.add","node":"01M782AVA6KNK88YZYWQT7QR7Q","payload":{"kind":"Hypothesis","parent":"01M782AJ93XSQTMWJXBN8QBRN8","title":"Status quo: a review is its own Experiment and counts against the budget (baseline)","body":"Keep skills/hyp-goal-run as it is at sha256 cb15e2f2. A review of a candidate is its own Experiment (--recipe none --rubric reading) with its own Result, and that Result counts in the stop clause. The baseline for line 7."},"why":"issue 141: a rival of the one question, as the owner decided"}
