 the skill text and scratch builds for each rival rule, kept under .tree/evidence/<E-id>/\nRead only: skills/, internal/, docs/, and every other investigations/ tree\nNever: edit skills/ or internal/; the change is a later build Goal\nNever: replace the installed hyp, or any binary outside .tree/evidence/\nNever: write under an owner actor, or merge a PR\n```\n\n**Still to do**\n- **Experiments.** The runner adds the Experiments and their verdict rules. I did not add them. Planned: one known-answer Experiment, the H-base trials, then one Experiment per cut.\n- **Build Goal.** The later build Goal is yours to add after the select.\n- **Issue #141.** It stays open. The commit message names it, but I did not post to it or push, because this machine has no network.\n- **Out-of-Goal finding.** `docs/how-hyp-improves-itself.md` says hyp states no run cap, but `hyp prompt` now prints one. It is in the checkpoint."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1062,"cache_read_input_tokens":98081,"output_tokens":1057,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1062,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1057,"cache_read_input_tokens":98081,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1062,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1062},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgyBuKzgGZCgyepfbanNV","requestRef":"330e5048-608a-4799-a660-c0768201571f","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"0e01e887-a65d-4eef-ba40-958fb057a405","timestamp":"2026-11-12T14:26:14.947Z","advisorModel":