+{"parentUuid":"3b501cf7-4887-412b-b2a7-f4f4690af88e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyBemqGFr6ko5z4rNKoK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The second reader is still running. My own preflight scan found one claim a run would contradict.\n\n- **The claim.** `docs/how-hyp-improves-itself.md:29` and ADR 0017 (`docs/adr/0017-the-ledger-is-the-stall-guard.md:20`) say a run's cap \"stays outside hyp\" and that a `/goal` prompt or a recipe states how many Experiments a run may take.\n- **Why it matters.** `hyp prompt` now prints the cap, a default of 5 that counts Results (`internal/cli/prompt.go:109` and `:167`). The docs say Experiments, and hyp does print the cap. H-raise-budget changes that default, and H-one-experiment depends on the Experiment/Result difference.\n- **Where it goes.** I'd put it in the build Goal's `May change:` as text the change makes wrong, and not ask you now. It was already named as F8 in the G-ZBM2RE stop.\n\nI'll check the reader's facts against the source when it finishes, then show you the routing table."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":905,"cache_read_input_tokens":92338,"output_tokens":622,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":278},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":905,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":622,"cache_read_input_tokens":92338,"cache_creation_input_tokens":905,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":905},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgyBemc8BJ8xPFWZNdNS8","requestRef":"67ce78c7-24dd-49d4-87b